#11000
The Mountain Monastery~
This area (11001-11051) was created as a mid to higher level exp gathering 
area.  Also included are items specifically for the shou-lin class.  My 
first area for RavenMUD.  I hope it brings hours of distraction.

Smythe
(Improved/Updated December 1995)
~
110 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#11001
Entrance of the Mountain Monastery~
    Candles in wall sconces light this small entryway.  A woven reed mat
covers the floor and there are wall pegs from which one could hang one's
cloak.  A dimly lit hallway leads north.
~
