#11014
Cubicle of the Monk Priest~
    Rudimentary  furnishings  adorn  this  room.  Next to the woven reed
sleeping mat is a small  shrine to Buddha,  with the familiar brazier of
incense.   It appears as if the Monk Priest spends most of his time here.
The only obvious exit is a heavy wooden door to the south.
~
