#11015
Hall of Martial Discipline~
    The sounds of monks completing various  physical  exercises echo from
the walls of this large room.   The  hall is  divided into  seperate areas
by function rather than actual physical barriers.  Separate practice areas
lie to the north, west and south.  A heavy wooden door lies to the east.
