#11050
Chamber of the Ivory Buddha~
    This room is resplendent with color, light, and golden reflections.
Mosaic tiles of white, red and black cover the floor.  Even the corners
of this room are brightly lit.  Directly across the room stands a 15 foot
tall statue.  Cupped in the statue's hands is the Sacred Ivory Buddha of
the Mountain Monks.
~
