#11070
Point of Tranquility~
   High above a huge mountain, this peak allows you the most beautiful view you
have ever seen.  As the sun touches the horizon, you feel as though all the
problems of the world might be solved from this very spot.  A small
weatherbeaten man seems to agree with you as he sits here and meditates
